WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.515
Unit five. Social Media Awareness!

2
00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:10.338
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.388 --> 00:00:14.215
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.265 --> 00:00:18.699
Today we learn about Social Media Awareness. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:24.292
Social media. Say it with me. Social media!

6
00:00:27.813 --> 00:00:32.713
Algorithm feed. Say it with me. Algorithm feed!

7
00:00:36.181 --> 00:00:40.639
Filter bubble. Say it with me. Filter bubble!

8
00:00:44.175 --> 00:00:48.875
Influencer. Say it with me. Influencer!

9
00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:56.654
Authentic. Say it with me. Authentic!

10
00:01:00.129 --> 00:01:04.923
Comparison trap. Say it with me. Comparison trap!

11
00:01:08.436 --> 00:01:12.436
Time limit. Say it with me. Time limit!

12
00:01:15.961 --> 00:01:20.477
Critical thinking. Say it with me. Critical thinking!

13
00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:40.327
Social media uses an algorithm feed that can create a filter bubble of similar content. Not every influencer is authentic, so avoiding the comparison trap takes critical thinking. Setting a time limit helps balance social media use.

14
00:01:40.377 --> 00:01:44.171
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:45.197 --> 00:01:50.902
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:50.952 --> 00:01:52.471
Filter bubble!

17
00:01:53.376 --> 00:01:58.899
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.949 --> 00:02:00.140
Time limit!

19
00:02:01.014 --> 00:02:11.189
Did you know? Social media algorithms are designed to show you more of what you already like, which can limit the variety of ideas you see!

20
00:02:11.239 --> 00:02:13.688
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:14.427 --> 00:02:24.398
Think and answer. What is a filter bubble, and why might it be a problem?

22
00:02:24.448 --> 00:02:25.742
Great answer!

23
00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:32.270
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:35.453
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

